ying the language their own  way of of enjoying learning the language  and so that's really  to me the importance of being a polyglot  it's not to demonstrate that we have  more languages are are better in  language a than language b the only  thing that matters is our enjoyment of  the language and so on that  on that note i would like to say you  know i wish you a very successful  conference  if you ever have a conference  uh in an area that's on the same  continent as i happen to be whether here  at home in north america or in europe i  will definitely make an effort to be  there  so uh zai jian adios  uh  arrivederci and uh whatever  good luck on the conference bye for now
 

